@baseUrl = http://localhost:5232

### Create a link with a custom code
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/links
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: aspnet-guide-create-1

{
  "originalUrl": "https://learn.microsoft.com/aspnet/core/",
  "customCode": "aspnet-guide"
}

### Create a link with a generated code and expiration
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/links
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: dotnet-guide-create-1

{
  "originalUrl": "https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/",
  "expiresAt": "2027-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### Redirect (replace the code with a code returned by create)
GET {{baseUrl}}/aspnet-guide

### Read click analytics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/links/aspnet-guide/analytics

### Invalid scheme (expected 400 Problem Details)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/links
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "javascript:alert(1)"
}

### Explicit null is rejected (expected 400 Problem Details)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/links
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": null
}

### Private metadata address is rejected (expected 400 Problem Details)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/links
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "http://169.254.169.254/latest/meta-data/"
}

### Credentials in URL are rejected (expected 400 Problem Details)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/links
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "https://user:password@example.com/"
}

### Reserved route code is rejected (expected 400 Problem Details)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/links
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "https://example.com/",
  "customCode": "health"
}

### Unknown code (expected 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/does-not-exist

### Unknown analytics code (expected 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/links/does-not-exist/analytics

### Liveness (process only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Readiness (checks store write access)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ready
